      "date": "2026-08-13 01:37:46.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(2 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nMostly good, minor comments inline. The removal itself checks out: SLAB_MEM_SPREAD was only honoured by mm/slab.c's alternate_node_alloc() under CONFIG_SLAB, no supported distro kernel in lustre/ChangeLog is a CONFIG_SLAB build, and a tree-wide grep confirms this was the last user, so dropping the flag and the shim together is self-contained.",
